    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i also need to make sure we have the right phrasing for our staff training docs regarding 'hidden' risks. what are some of the specific signs or indicators that suggest a batch might have been left in the danger zone for too long? like, what should they be looking out for if they suspect contamination has already started?",
